{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13207120","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13207120","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1320712001:0":{"text":"哦，你可算来了！你的族人说有办法解决咕布林破坏栅栏的问题，我已经等了好久。","source_cn":"哦，你可算来了！你的族人说有办法解决咕布林破坏栅栏的问...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x373F96DDA1188635","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1320712002:1":{"text":"那帮家伙的嘴挺快啊，我才想出新点子，老约恩这就告诉你了？","source_cn":"那帮家伙的嘴挺快啊，我才想出新点子，老约恩这就告诉你了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC17DB825E5807C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320712003:1":{"text":"我马上请小铁牙出来，你们瞧好吧。","source_cn":"我马上请小铁牙出来，你们瞧好吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCB50BB6B83E05B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320712004:1":{"text":"小铁牙？小铁牙是谁？","source_cn":"小铁牙？小铁牙是谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DF6C0D447591C2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320712005:1":{"text":"是我做的防护栅栏。","source_cn":"是我做的防护栅栏。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1734320146FAB237","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320712006:1